  (text "2) TPS63900 BUCK-BOOST -> 3.3V (Iq 75nA)\nSEL=GND -> VO(1) theo CFG3=16.2k = 3.3V\nCFG1=36.5k (VO(2)=3.3V), CFG2=0R: Iin khong gioi han\nR CFG 1%/100ppm, khong dat tu tren chan CFG.\nL1 2.2uH Isat>=2A; COUT 2x22uF; CIN 10uF."
